      ],
      "answer": "=COUNTIF(D2:D13, \">5\")"
    },
    {
      "prompt": "In H4, add up the price of every Latte with SUMIF: =SUMIF(B2:B13, \"Latte\", D2:D13).",
      "teach": "**SUMIF(range, criteria, sum_range)** checks the condition in one column, then adds up the matching rows from **another** column. Here it checks the drinks (B) and adds up the prices (D).",
