    {
      "prompt": "Last one: in H6, count Maya's orders. Her name is already typed in I6, so point the criteria at that cell: =COUNTIF(E2:E13, I6).",
      "teach": "The criteria can be a **cell** instead of typed text. Change the name in I6 later and the count updates, which is how analysts build little dashboards.",
